DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/email/rules/{rule_id}
Removes a DLP email scanning rule. The rule will no longer be applied to email messages.
Required: account_id (path); rule_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/email/rules/{rule_id}
Gets detailed configuration for a specific DLP email scanning rule, including detection patterns and actions.
Required: account_id (path); rule_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/dlp/email/rules/{rule_id}
Updates a DLP email scanning rule.
Required: account_id (path); rule_id (path); body (body) — Rule description.
